%% Source snapshot: 2026-10-27. Selected browser, API and DNS worker flows.
%% DNS/provider I/O occurs in background jobs, not cached reads or recheck requests.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Customer browser
    participant Portal as Portal views and signed client
    participant SQLite as Portal SQLite
    participant Platform as Platform API and domain services
    participant DB as Platform PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Django-Q2 dispatcher and worker
    participant External as DNS authorities or Cloudflare

    Note over Browser,DB: Login uses Platform credential validation
    Browser->>Portal: POST /login/ with form and CSRF token
    Portal->>Portal: Validate form input
    Portal->>Platform: POST /api/users/login/ with signed JSON
    Note over Portal,Platform: X-Portal-Id, X-Nonce, X-Timestamp, X-Body-Hash, X-Signature
    Platform->>Platform: Verify service signature and replay controls
    Platform->>DB: Authenticate user and load permitted memberships
    DB-->>Platform: Canonical identity and current authorization state
    Platform-->>Portal: Identity, membership and session-authentication data
    Portal->>SQLite: Persist server-side session
    Portal-->>Browser: Set-Cookie portal_session and redirect to customer page

    Note over Browser,External: Saved DNS status and a bounded manual recheck
    Browser->>Portal: GET service DNS card
    Portal->>Platform: POST /api/services/{id}/dns-status/ with signed identity
    Platform->>DB: Read saved status and current routing/ownership generation
    DB-->>Platform: Saved observation and freshness inputs
    Platform-->>Portal: Versioned public status with private evidence omitted
    Portal-->>Browser: Render cached status
    Browser->>Portal: POST recheck with CSRF token
    Portal->>Platform: POST /api/services/{id}/dns-status/recheck/
    Platform->>DB: Verify owner/tech and persist due work
    Platform-->>Portal: 202 with current pending state
    Portal-->>Browser: Redirect or bounded status polling
    Worker->>DB: Dispatch and claim due work under a live lease
    Worker->>External: Bounded DNS probes
    Worker->>DB: Fence generation and save results and incident state

    Note over Browser,External: Customer-zone import and provider publication
    Browser->>Portal: Multipart zone-file upload with CSRF token
    Portal->>Platform: Signed JSON with bounded base64 upload
    Platform->>DB: Parse and save complete immutable inventory and proposal
    Platform-->>Portal: Paginated preview without nameserver instructions yet
    Browser->>Portal: Confirm exact revision and digest
    Portal->>Platform: Signed confirmation intent
    Platform->>DB: Verify current binding and save durable operation
    Worker->>DB: Claim operation and verify account/name publication fence
    Worker->>External: Typed gateway calls and authoritative cross-checks
    Worker->>DB: Save owned-record readback and readiness checkpoints
    Note over Browser,DB: Later reads offer nameservers only while readiness remains current
